ces "da28792d-7e06-5767-aad7-2595e7c73360"] [:db/add "864c5598-9156-5d36-8b8b-5bc486fb360e" :answer-field/choices "5624578c-9ed4-5d1d-8308-55acb5c32d9e"] [:db/add "864c5598-9156-5d36-8b8b-5bc486fb360e" :answer-field/choices "2d100bf7-7d4f-5af6-af2c-db16d0a8adb6"] [:db/add "864c5598-9156-5d36-8b8b-5bc486fb360e" :answer-field/choices "0865e5e6-e6c7-5296-9fa7-7d15cea50189"] [:db/add "864c5598-9156-5d36-8b8b-5bc486fb360e" :answer-field/choices "58e1f332-72b1-5ff5-b964-d3df0cfeeb03"] [:db/add "864c5598-9156-5d36-8b8b-5bc486fb360e" :answer-field/correct "5624578c-9ed4-5d1d-8308-55acb5c32d9e"] [:db/ensure "864c5598-9156-5d36-8b8b-5bc486fb360e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "af6c6d60-cae6-5d18-8d70-a0531e86ff1d" :question/id #uuid "af6c6d60-cae6-5d18-8d70-a0531e86ff1d"] [:db/add "af6c6d60-cae6-5d18-8d70-a0531e86ff1d" :question/problem "A forex trader's annual profits have been *decreasing* continuously at a rate of $12\\%$ per year. Her profit this year is $\\$24900$. What was her profit $3$ years ago? Round your answer to the nearest dollar.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."] [:db/add "af6c6d60-cae6-5d18-8d70-a0531e86ff1d" :question/worked-solution "Use the continuously compounded growth equation $P=P_0e^{rt}$. The current amount is $P=24900$, the rate is $r=-0.12$ (negative for decay), and the elapsed time is $t=3$ years. The time unit matches the rate. Substitute and divide by the exponential factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n24900 &= P_0e^{(-0.12)(3)} \\\\\n24900 &= P_0e^{-0.36} \\\\\ne^{-0.36} &\\approx 0.69767633 \\\\\nP_0 &= \\frac{24900}{e^{-0.36}} \\\\\n&\\approx 35689.90242255 \\\\\n&\\approx 35690\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe earlier profit was $\\$35690$. Round only the final amount; keep full calculator precision in the exponential factor."] [:db/add "af6c6d60-cae6-5d18-8d70-a0531e86ff1d" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "af6c6d60-cae6-5d18-8d70-a0531e86ff1d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/a