ired to answer this question."] [:db/add "ba14475a-2082-5ab3-b0c8-98a0a5cde4da" :question/worked-solution "Use the continuously compounded growth equation $P=P_0e^{rt}$. The current amount is $P=3.46$, the rate is $r=0.022$ (positive for growth), and the elapsed time is $t=7$ months. The time unit matches the rate. Substitute and divide by the exponential factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3.46 &= P_0e^{(0.022)(7)} \\\\\n3.46 &= P_0e^{0.154} \\\\\ne^{0.154} &\\approx 1.16649089 \\\\\nP_0 &= \\frac{3.46}{e^{0.154}} \\\\\n&\\approx 2.96616119 \\\\\n&\\approx 2.97\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe earlier gas price was $\\$2.97$ per gallon. Round only the final amount; keep full calculator precision in the exponential factor."] [:db/add "ba14475a-2082-5ab3-b0c8-98a0a5cde4da" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "ba14475a-2082-5ab3-b0c8-98a0a5cde4da" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ba14475a-2082-5ab3-b0c8-98a0a5cde4da" :question/answer-fields "b250450b-71e2-5a0f-b210-ed72a27b9f96"] [:db/ensure "ba14475a-2082-5ab3-b0c8-98a0a5cde4da" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059796 :knowledge-point/questions "ba14475a-2082-5ab3-b0c8-98a0a5cde4da"] [:db/add "0f8ee2f8-2e55-5f7e-af51-be6842b25904" :answer/id #uuid "0f8ee2f8-2e55-5f7e-af51-be6842b25904"] [:db/add "0f8ee2f8-2e55-5f7e-af51-be6842b25904" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "0f8ee2f8-2e55-5f7e-af51-be6842b25904" :answer/value "$\\$31362$"] [:db/ensure "0f8ee2f8-2e55-5f7e-af51-be6842b25904" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e6aeaf52-4e30-5840-8f5d-1dc5bdda4072" :answer/id #uuid "e6aeaf52-4e30-5840-8f5d-1dc5bdda4072"] [:db/add "e6aeaf52-4e30-5840-8f5d-1dc5bdda4072" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "e6aeaf52-4e30-5840-8f5d-1dc5bdda4072" :answer/value "$\\$30169$"] [:db/ensure "e6aeaf52-4e30-5840-8f5d-1dc5bdda4072" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7df1d530-a918-5038-b657-d44cc1b6c8c5" :answer/id #uuid "7df1d530-a918-5038-b657-d44cc1b6c8c5"] [:db/add "7df1d530-a918-5038-b657-d44cc1b6c8c5" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "7df1d530-a918-5038-b657-d44cc1b6c8c5" :answer/value "$\\$28986$"] [:db/ensure "7df1d530-a918-5038-b657-d44cc1b6c8c5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84" :answer/id #uuid "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84"] [:db/add "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84" :answer/value "$\\$27849$"] [:db/ensure "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4b81ee12-aa86-5745-9b1d-09633de518b3" :answer/id #uuid "4b81ee12-aa86-5745-9b1d-09633de518b3"] [:db/add "4b81ee12-aa86-5745-9b1d-09633de518b3" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "4b81ee12-aa86-5745-9b1d-09633de518b3" :answer/value "$\\$31400$"] [:db/ensure "4b81ee12-aa86-5745-9b1d-09633de518b3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/id #uuid "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/choices "0f8ee2f8-2e55-5f7e-af51-be6842b25904"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/choices "e6aeaf52-4e30-5840-8f5d-1dc5bdda4072"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/choices "7df1d530-a918-5038-b657-d44cc1b6c8c5"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/choices "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/choices "4b81ee12-aa86-5745-9b1d-09633de518b3"] [:db/add "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/correct "fc1d87e7-7a71-56fb-a19c-3774ca121d84"] [:db/ensure "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/id #uuid "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d"] [:db/add "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/problem "A forex trader's annual profits have been *growing* continuously at a rate of $4\\%$ per year. Her profit this year is $\\$31400$. What was her profit $3$ years ago? Round your answer to the nearest dollar.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."] [:db/add "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/worked-solution "Use the continuously compounded growth equation $P=P_0e^{rt}$. The current amount is $P=31400$, the rate is $r=0.04$ (positive for growth), and the elapsed time is $t=3$ years. The time unit matches the rate. Substitute and divide by the exponential factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n31400 &= P_0e^{(0.04)(3)} \\\\\n31400 &= P_0e^{0.12} \\\\\ne^{0.12} &\\approx 1.12749685 \\\\\nP_0 &= \\frac{31400}{e^{0.12}} \\\\\n&\\approx 27849.30171292 \\\\\n&\\approx 27849\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe earlier profit was $\\$27849$. Round only the final amount; keep full calculator precision in the exponential factor."] [:db/add "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/answer-fields "dd23d94f-48bb-5788-9bc6-bb8735d2fa18"] [:db/ensure "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059796 :knowledge-point/questions "0b570077-e6f8-5a37-946f-d9c06a31ad0d"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "7b905f2b-1690-54df-85bb-6a3eff27c82a"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/4f/4f90e6eed9e2671a59e0f1f1892ed9409127627973cb7984fd4acb9bbda93ff8/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186059796 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186059796 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186676319 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186676320 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186676330 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186676340 :question/retired